{"id":"n43493-1-7","stage":5,"title":"구겨지다 · 皱","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n43493-1-7-1","ko":"서류가 왜 이렇게 구겨지고 엉망인가?","zh":"文件怎么会被弄得这么皱巴巴、乱七八糟的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서류가","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구겨지고","meaning":"皱，褶皱，起皱","explanation":"구겨지다：皱，褶皱，起皱；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"구겨지다","audio":"/audio/af26a89423f2c87c925f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43493","senseId":"1","lemma":"구겨지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엉망인가?","meaning":"杂乱，混杂","explanation":"엉망：杂乱，混杂；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"엉망","audio":"/audio/ff4e0c9a8436a25a7ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15195","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉망","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"af26a89423f2c87c","term":"구겨지다","zh":"皱，褶皱，起皱","audio":"/audio/af26a89423f2c87c925f.mp3","entryId":"43493","definition":"起褶子。","pronunciation":["구겨지다"]},{"id":"ff4e0c9a8436a25a","term":"엉망","zh":"杂乱，混杂","audio":"/audio/ff4e0c9a8436a25a7ba5.mp3","entryId":"15195","definition":"某东西、场所或氛围等乱糟糟或复杂的状态。","pronunciation":["엉망"]}],"audio":"/audio/872f4bb9ebe7122020bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n43493-1-7-2","ko":"죄송합니다. 새로 출력해 오겠습니다.","zh":"对不起，我马上重新打印一份过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송합니다.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출력해","meaning":"打印","explanation":"출력하다：打印；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"출력하다","audio":"/audio/a802c551e23fbc7806ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79129","senseId":"1","lemma":"출력하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오겠습니다.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"a802c551e23fbc78","term":"출력하다","zh":"打印","audio":"/audio/a802c551e23fbc7806ec.mp3","entryId":"79129","definition":"在电脑等机器或设备上输入内容，经过操作后向外输出结果。","pronunciation":["출려카